  "description": "Akisa is a faux Japanese display typeface featuring amusing characters that you may use for a variety of design projects. You will create a project that is striking and memorable in the mind of the entire audience if you use this typeface.\nLogotypes, food banners, branding, brochure, posters, movie titles, book titles, quotes, and more may all benefit from this font.\nOf course, using this font in your various design projects will make them excellent and outstanding; many viewers are drawn to the striking and unusual graphic display.\nStart utilizing this typeface in your projects to make them stand out.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Akisa is a faux Japanese display typeface featuring amusing characters that you may use for a variety of design projects. You will create a project that is striking and memorable in the mind of the entire audience if you use this typeface.</p>\n<p>Logotypes, food banners, branding, brochure, posters, movie titles, book titles, quotes, and more may all benefit from this font.</p>\n<p>Of course, using this font in your various design projects will make them excellent and outstanding; many viewers are drawn to the striking and unusual graphic display.</p>\n<p>Start utilizing this typeface in your projects to make them stand out.</p>",
